      "code": "// 受检异常必须表态：要么接住，要么继续往签名上写\nString read(String p) throws IOException {          // 往上抛\n  return Files.readString(Path.of(p));\n}\n\nString safeRead(String p) {\n  try {\n    return read(p);\n  } catch (IOException e) {\n    throw new UncheckedIOException(e);              // 包成不受检\n  }\n}\n\n// 保留原因：构造函数收 cause，或事后 initCause\nthrow new ConfigException(\"读配置失败\", original);\ne.getCause();                                       // 取回根因",
